  <body style="s0">
    <div>
      <p begin="13.59s" xml:id="p0" end="20.02s">Gave you too much, now I&#039;m swallowed</p>
      <p begin="20.02s" xml:id="p1" end="26.56s">Now I&#039;m the fool, why are you breaking rules?</p>
      <p begin="26.56s" xml:id="p2" end="33.64s">The dangerous path that I follow, oh</p>
      <p begin="33.64s" xml:id="p3" end="40.27s">Go on, just do what you do, oh yeah</p>
      <p begin="40.27s" xml:id="p4" end="45.37s">Hurts</p>
      <p begin="45.37s" xml:id="p5" end="47.6s">As I bleed for you</p>
      <p begin="47.6s" xml:id="p6" end="51.68s">Cry for you, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="51.68s" xml:id="p7" end="56.68s">Let me bleed</p>
      <p begin="58.72s" xml:id="p8" end="60.83s">As I bleed for you</p>
      <p begin="60.83s" xml:id="p9" end="64.96s">Cry for you, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="64.96s" xml:id="p10" end="71.79s">Let me bleed</p>
      <p begin="71.79s" xml:id="p11" end="78.17s">Let me bleed</p>
      <p begin="78.17s" xml:id="p12" end="79.8s">Let me</p>
      <p begin="119.56s" xml:id="p13" end="125.75s">All of the pain seem to follow</p>
      <p begin="125.75s" xml:id="p14" end="132.66s">Like a shadow, dark and cold the touch</p>
      <p begin="132.66s" xml:id="p15" end="139.5s">Am I insane not to let go? Oh</p>
      <p begin="139.5s" xml:id="p16" end="145.89s">Go on, just do what you do, oh yeah</p>
      <p begin="145.89s" xml:id="p17" end="151.34s">Hurts</p>
      <p begin="151.34s" xml:id="p18" end="153.4s">As I bleed for you</p>
      <p begin="153.4s" xml:id="p19" end="157.58s">Cry for you, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="157.58s" xml:id="p20" end="162.45s">Let me bleed</p>
      <p begin="164.5s" xml:id="p21" end="166.58s">As I bleed for you</p>
      <p begin="166.58s" xml:id="p22" end="170.63s">Cry for you, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="170.63s" xml:id="p23" end="177.65s">Let me bleed</p>
      <p begin="177.65s" xml:id="p24" end="184.06s">Let me bleed</p>
